    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "City Homes are Dublin 12's local estate agents and we are delighted to offer number 34 Limekiln Road to the open market for sale. This is a large 4 bedroom bungalow that is situated within the highly regarded Manor Estate sector of Terenure.\r\nWhile the property will require some upgrading works it offers a huge amount of benefits to its new owners including a large garage to the side which can facilitate the further enlargement of the home, a south facing rear garden, a large driveway to the front and external wrap around insulation.\r\nThe interior accommodation consists of a large welcoming hallway, a spacious lounge room, a separate fitted kitchen, 2 good sized bedrooms on the ground floor level, a fully tiled bathroom, a master bedroom & further single bedroom are positioned on the upper floor level.\r\nIn the vicinity you will find a choice of shops, bars, restaurants and supermarkets. The city centre is located just 6.5km away and easily accessible with a choice of reliable bus routes in operation. For locations further afield, the M50 motorway is approximately a 6 minutes drive away.\r\nThe Manor Estate neighbourhood is often regarded as the premier address in the vicinity and is located convenient to the villages of Templeogue, Terenure and Rathfarnham.\r\nIn close proximity you will find Riverview Educate Together, Bishop Shanahan National School, Our Lady's Terenure, Terenure College, Templeogue College and St. Mac Dara's College. Just a stones throw away are the vast grounds of Tymon Park which offer over 300 acres of green space, forestry and playgrounds to explore."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION **please see floor plan for dimensions\r\nHall\r\n*A wide and welcoming entrance with hardwood flooring\r\nLounge\r\n*A bright and spacious reception room with wood flooring and a feature brick fireplace\r\nKitchen\r\n*A fitted kitchen with tiled flooring and part tiled walls. Direct access to the rear garden\r\nInternal hallway\r\n*A dividing room with hardwood flooring\r\nBedroom 1\r\n*A double bedroom with fitted wardrobes and hardwood flooring\r\nBedroom 2\r\n*A double bedroom with original exposed hardwood flooring\r\nBedroom 3\r\n*A spacious and bright master bedroom with fitted wardrobes, hardwood flooring and a storage area which could suit conversion into an ensuite bathroom\r\nBedroom 4\r\n*A single bedroom to the front\r\nBathroom\r\n*A fully tiled bathroom suite"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "1. A large 4 bedroom bungalow (92m2 / 990ft2)\r\n2. Garage to the side\r\n3. Prime residential neighbourhood\r\n4. South facing rear garden\r\n5. Huge potential to upgrade to suit personal specifications\r\n6. Wrap around external insulation\r\n7. GFCH / Off-street car parking x4 / Double glazing\r\n8. 2 minute walk to the stunning and vast grounds of Tymon Park\r\n9. Easy access into the city centre (6.5km away) / choice of bus routes in operation / M50 motorway just 6 minutes drive away\r\n10. An array of amenities and shopping options with the vicinity / Choice of well established junior & senior level schools"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: E1"
      }
